#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:49
msgid "Maximum takes the brightest pixel in the neighbourhood, so bright areas grow (dilate); minimum takes the darkest, so they shrink (erode)."
msgstr "最大值取邻域内最亮的像素，亮区因此外扩（膨胀）；最小值取最暗的，亮区收缩（腐蚀）。"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:58
#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:237
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形状"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:59
msgid "Square is the (±r, ±r) window; round is a disc of radius r. The counterpart of Photoshop's Preserve: Squareness / Roundness."
msgstr "方形即 (±r, ±r) 方窗，圆形即半径 r 的圆盘。对应 Photoshop 的「保留：方形度 / 圆度」。"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:63
#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:228
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "半径"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:64
msgid "Neighbourhood radius in pixels. r=1 means a 3×3 window and grows the edge outward by one pixel. Limited to 1–100, same as Photoshop."
msgstr "邻域半径（像素）。r=1 即 3×3 窗口，边缘向外长一圈。与 Photoshop 一样限制在 1–100。"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:70
msgid "Affect Alpha"
msgstr "影响 alpha"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:71
msgid "Whether alpha takes part in the extremum. Off by default: Photoshop does not change layer opacity either, and letting a cut-out edge dilate is rarely what you want."
msgstr "是否连 alpha 一起取极值。默认关：Photoshop 同样不改图层透明度，让抠图边缘跟着膨胀往往不是想要的结果。"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:278
msgid "Maximum / Minimum"
msgstr "最大值 / 最小值"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:279
msgid "Morphological dilate (maximum) and erode (minimum) over a square or round neighbourhood: expands or shrinks bright areas. The equivalent of Photoshop's Maximum / Minimum filter, computed in the buffer's own precision."
msgstr "在方形或圆形邻域上做形态学膨胀（最大值）与腐蚀（最小值）：亮区外扩或收缩。等价于 Photoshop 的最大值 / 最小值滤镜，按缓冲区自身的精度计算。"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:44
msgid "Maximum (dilate)"
msgstr "最大值（膨胀）"

#: ops/max-min/max-min.c:45
msgid "Minimum (erode)"
msgstr "最小值（腐蚀）"

