msgid "Channel to selection: turns the channel selected in the Channels dock into a pixel selection."
msgstr "通道 → 选区：把通道面板里选中的那条通道变成像素选区"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:412
msgid "Selection to channel: saves the current selection as a new channel."
msgstr "选区 → 通道：把当前选区存成一条新通道"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:418
msgid "Channel to mask: uses the selected channel's grey as the mask of the selected layer."
msgstr "通道 → 蒙版：用选中通道的灰度做所选图层的蒙版"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:423
msgid "Mask to channel: turns the selected layer's mask into a new channel."
msgstr "蒙版 → 通道：把所选图层的蒙版变成一条新通道"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:428
msgid "Selection to mask: attaches the current selection as the mask of the selected layer."
msgstr "选区 → 蒙版：把当前选区挂成所选图层的蒙版"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:433
msgid "Mask to selection: turns the selected layer's mask into a pixel selection."
msgstr "蒙版 → 选区：把所选图层的蒙版变成像素选区"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:440
msgid "Path to selection: turns the path selected in the Paths dock into a pixel selection."
msgstr "路径 → 选区：把路径面板里选中的那条路径变成像素选区"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:446
msgid "Selection to path: traces the current selection into a new path (same geometry as the native To Path)."
msgstr "选区 → 路径：把当前选区描成一条新路径（几何与原生 To Path 相同）"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:451
msgid "Path to channel: rasterises the selected path into a new channel."
msgstr "路径 → 通道：把选中路径栅格化成一条新通道"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:456
msgid "Channel to path: traces the 50% contour of the selected channel into a new path."
msgstr "通道 → 路径：把选中通道的 50% 等值线描成一条新路径"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:462
msgid "Path to mask: rasterises the selected path into the mask of the selected layer."
msgstr "路径 → 蒙版：把选中路径栅格化成所选图层的蒙版"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py:467
msgid "Mask to path: traces the outline of the selected layer's mask into a new path."
msgstr "蒙版 → 路径：把所选图层蒙版的轮廓描成一条新路径"

