#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:531
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:660
#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:190
msgid "\n(This image has transparency, so the layers went into a group automatically: the group mask preserves it.)"
msgstr "\n（这张图带透明，已自动分组：透明度靠组蒙版保住。）"

#: plugin/dodge-burn/dodge-burn.py:248
msgid "Dodge & Burn: creates a dodge and a burn curve layer, both with a fully black mask. Paint with a soft white brush on a mask and only what you paint gets lighter or darker; everywhere else stays pixel-identical to the original."
msgstr "双曲线磨皮：生成提亮、压暗两条曲线层，蒙版全黑。用白色柔边画笔在蒙版上涂抹，涂到哪里就提亮/压暗到哪里，没涂的地方与原图逐像素相同。"

#: plugin/dodge-burn/dodge-burn.py:253
msgid "Strength (%)"
msgstr "强度（%）"

#: plugin/dodge-burn/dodge-burn.py:254
msgid "How far the curve lifts or lowers the midtones: 12 means 0.12 at 0.5 (about 30 levels)."
msgstr "曲线在中间调抬升/下压的幅度：12 表示 0.5 处抬 0.12（约 30 码）"

#: plugin/dodge-burn/dodge-burn.py:257
#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:256
#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:310
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:531
#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:541
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:588
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:717
#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:224
msgid "Put in a layer group"
msgstr "收进图层组"

#: plugin/dodge-burn/dodge-burn.py:258
msgid "Puts both layers into a pass-through group named Dodge & Burn; turn it off to stack them directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把两层放进一个「双曲线磨皮」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/dodge-burn/dodge-burn.py:264
#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:263
#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:231
msgid "Select exactly one layer."
msgstr "请选择一个图层"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:137
msgid "Gaussian blur (low frequency)"
msgstr "高斯模糊（低频）"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:147
msgid "High pass (high frequency)"
msgstr "高通（高频）"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:162
#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:219
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:337
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:418
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:488
#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:366
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:393
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:475
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:545
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:523
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:604
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:674
msgid "Nothing to split: no layer."
msgstr "没有可以拆分的图层"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:165
#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:222
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:340
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:421
#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:491
#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:369
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:396
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:478
#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:548
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:526
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:607
#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:677
msgid "A layer group cannot be split; pick a raster layer first (right-click the group, then Merge Group)."
msgstr "图层组不能拆分：请先选一个栅格图层（右键 → 合并组）"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:184
#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:242
msgid "Frequency Separation"
msgstr "高低频磨皮 (Frequency Separation)"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:189
msgid "1 · Low frequency (tone)"
msgstr "1 · 低频（影调）"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:197
msgid "2 · High frequency (detail)"
msgstr "2 · 高频（细节）"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:215
msgid "Frequency Separation is set up: a low-frequency layer (gaussian blur %g px, carries tone and colour) and a high-frequency layer (grain merge, carries pores and blemishes). Hide the original layer and the two still reproduce it. To change the strength, change the blur radius of the low-frequency layer."
msgstr "高低频磨皮已建立：低频层（高斯模糊 %g px，管影调与颜色）、高频层（颗粒合并，管毛孔与痘印）。原图层可以隐藏，两层自己就能还原。改磨皮力度＝改低频层的高斯模糊半径。"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:247
msgid "Frequency Separation: creates a low-frequency layer (gaussian blur, carries tone and colour) and a high-frequency layer (grain merge, carries detail and texture) in one go; with identity settings the composite is the original. Smooth colour on the low layer and retouch detail on the high layer without disturbing each other."
msgstr "高低频磨皮：一次生成低频（高斯模糊，管影调与颜色）与高频（颗粒合并，管细节与质感）两层，恒等时合成就是原图。在低频层抹平色块、在高频层修细节，互不干扰。"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:252
msgid "Split radius (px)"
msgstr "分离半径（px）"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:253
msgid "Standard deviation of the gaussian blur. Larger pushes more into the low frequency and leaves less detail in the high one."
msgstr "高斯模糊的标准差。越大，进低频的东西越多、高频留下的细节越少"

#: plugin/frequency-separation/frequency-separation.py:257
msgid "Puts both layers into a pass-through group named Frequency Separation; turn it off to stack them directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把两层放进一个「高低频磨皮」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:155
msgid "Required operations are missing: %s. They are essential for exact HSI fitting (I and S have no counterpart among GIMP's component blend modes and can only be computed together). Install this repository's GEGL operations hsi-dual / hsi-compose (./install.sh) and restart GIMP."
msgstr "缺少适配算子：%s。它们是 HSI 精确适配的必需组件（I 与 S 在 GIMP 的分量混合模式里都没有对应项，只能联合计算）。请先安装本仓库的 GEGL 算子的 hsi-dual / hsi-compose（./install.sh），重启 GIMP 再试。"

#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:272
msgid "HSI layers created: %s. The S curve lives in \"2 · S curve\" (red channel), the I curve in \"3 · I curve\" (green channel) and the hue curve in \"4 · H curve\" (blue channel). Hide the original layer; this one reproduces it on its own."
msgstr "HSI 层已建立：%s。S 曲线在「2 · S curve」（红通道）、I 曲线在「3 · I curve」（绿通道）、色相曲线在「4 · H curve」（蓝通道）。原图层可以隐藏，这一层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:305
msgid "Adjust curves in HSI space: builds a three-channel data image (red = saturation, green = intensity, blue = hue) with one curve per component. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly, and editing a curve only moves that HSI component."
msgstr "在 HSI 空间里调曲线：生成一张三联数据图（红通道 = 饱和度、绿通道 = 强度、蓝通道 = 色相），三条曲线各管一个分量。恒等曲线时精确还原原图，调哪条曲线就只动那个 HSI 分量。"

#: plugin/hsi-split-curves/hsi-split-curves.py:311
msgid "Puts this layer into a pass-through group named HSI split; turn it off to stack it directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把这一层放进一个「HSI split」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:271
msgid "Required operations are missing: %s. They are essential for exact HSL fitting (S and L must be computed together and cannot be replaced by a 1D curve). Install this repository's GEGL operations hsl-dual / hsl-compose (./install.sh) and restart GIMP."
msgstr "缺少适配算子：%s。它们是 HSL 精确适配的必需组件（S 与 L 必须联合计算，无法用一维曲线代替）。请先安装本仓库的 GEGL 算子的 hsl-dual / hsl-compose（./install.sh），重启 GIMP 再试。"

#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:401
msgid "HSL component layers created: %s. The S curve lives in \"2 · S curve\" (red channel), the L curve in \"3 · L curve\" (green channel) and the hue curve in the Hue layer's \"2 · H curve\". Hide the original layers; these two reproduce it on their own."
msgstr "HSL 分量层已建立：%s。S 曲线在「2 · S curve」（红通道）、L 曲线在「3 · L curve」（绿通道）、色相曲线在 Hue 层的「2 · H curve」。原图层可以隐藏，这两层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:471
msgid "HSL layers created: %s. The S curve lives in \"2 · S curve\" (red channel), the L curve in \"3 · L curve\" (green channel) and the hue curve in \"4 · H curve\" (blue channel). Hide the original layer; this one reproduces it on its own."
msgstr "HSL 层已建立：%s。S 曲线在「2 · S curve」（红通道）、L 曲线在「3 · L curve」（绿通道）、色相曲线在「4 · H curve」（蓝通道）。 原图层可以隐藏，这一层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:522
msgid "Adjust curves in HSL space: multi mode splits the layer into component layers, attaches one curve to each and stacks them back with GIMP's native component blend modes, so every layer can be switched off separately. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly."
msgstr "在 HSL 空间里调曲线：multi 模式把图层拆成分量层，各挂一条曲线，用 GIMP 原生的分量混合模式叠回去，每层可以单独关掉。恒等曲线时精确还原原图。"

#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:526
msgid "Adjust curves in HSL space: single mode packs the three components into one data image, one curve per channel, then an operation decodes it back to colour. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly; one layer, five filters."
msgstr "在 HSL 空间里调曲线：single 模式把三个分量打包进一张数据图，三条曲线各管一个通道，再由一个算子解回颜色。恒等曲线时精确还原原图，一层五条滤镜。"

#: plugin/hsl-split-curves/hsl-split-curves.py:532
msgid "Puts this layer into a pass-through group named HSL split; turn it off to stack it directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把这一层放进一个「HSL split」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:200
msgid "Required operations are missing: %s. They are essential for exact HSV fitting (all three components must be evaluated in the same data image). Install this repository's GEGL operations hsv-dual / hsv-compose (./install.sh) and restart GIMP."
msgstr "缺少适配算子：%s。它们是 HSV 精确适配的必需组件（三个分量必须在同一张数据图里一起算）。请先安装本仓库的 GEGL 算子 hsv-dual / hsv-compose（./install.sh），重启 GIMP 再试。"

#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:426
msgid "HSV component layers created (multi mode): %s. Editing each layer's \"2 · curve\" adjusts that component; leave the encode step alone. Every layer can be switched off separately. Hide the original layer; these three stack back on their own."
msgstr "HSV 分量层已建立（multi 模式）：%s。改每层「2 · curve」就是调该分量的曲线；encode 那步别动。每层都能单独关掉。原图层可以隐藏，这三层自己就能叠回去。"

#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:495
msgid "HSV layers created: %s. The S curve lives in \"2 · S curve\" (red channel), the V curve in \"3 · V curve\" (green channel) and the hue curve in \"4 · H curve\" (blue channel). Hide the original layer; this one reproduces it on its own."
msgstr "HSV 层已建立：%s。S 曲线在「2 · S curve」（红通道）、V 曲线在「3 · V curve」（绿通道）、色相曲线在「4 · H curve」（蓝通道）。 原图层可以隐藏，这一层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:531
msgid "Adjust curves in HSV space: multi mode splits the layer into component layers, attaches one curve to each and stacks them back with GIMP's native component blend modes, so every layer can be switched off separately. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly."
msgstr "在 HSV 空间里调曲线：multi 模式把图层拆成分量层，各挂一条曲线，用 GIMP 原生的分量混合模式叠回去，每层可以单独关掉。恒等曲线时精确还原原图。"

#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:535
msgid "Adjust curves in HSV space: single mode packs the three components into one data image, one curve per channel, then an operation decodes it back to colour. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly; one layer, five filters."
msgstr "在 HSV 空间里调曲线：single 模式把三个分量打包进一张数据图，三条曲线各管一个通道，再由一个算子解回颜色。恒等曲线时精确还原原图，一层五条滤镜。"

#: plugin/hsv-split-curves/hsv-split-curves.py:542
msgid "Puts the result into a pass-through group named HSV split; turn it off to stack it directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把结果放进一个「HSV split」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:327
msgid "Required operations are missing: %s. They are essential for exact Lab fitting (a and b must be computed together and cannot be replaced by a 1D curve). Install this repository's GEGL operations lab-dual / lab-compose (./install.sh) and restart GIMP."
msgstr "缺少适配算子：%s。它们是 Lab 精确适配的必需组件（a 与 b 必须联合计算，无法用一维曲线代替）。请先安装本仓库的 GEGL 算子的 lab-dual / lab-compose（./install.sh），重启 GIMP 再试。"

#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:458
msgid "Lab component layers created: %s. The a curve lives in \"2 · a curve\" (red channel), the b curve in \"3 · b curve\" (green channel) and the lightness curve in the L layer's \"2 · L curve\". Hide the original layers; these two reproduce it on their own."
msgstr "Lab 分量层已建立：%s。a 曲线在「2 · a curve」（红通道）、b 曲线在「3 · b curve」（绿通道）、明度曲线在 L 层的「2 · L curve」。原图层可以隐藏，这两层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:528
msgid "Lab layers created: %s. The a curve lives in \"2 · a curve\" (red channel), the b curve in \"3 · b curve\" (green channel) and the L curve in \"4 · L curve\" (blue channel). Hide the original layer; this one reproduces it on its own."
msgstr "Lab 层已建立：%s。a 曲线在「2 · a curve」（红通道）、b 曲线在「3 · b curve」（绿通道）、L 曲线在「4 · L curve」（蓝通道）。 原图层可以隐藏，这一层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:579
msgid "Adjust curves in Lab space: multi mode splits the layer into component layers, attaches one curve to each and stacks them back with GIMP's native component blend modes, so every layer can be switched off separately. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly."
msgstr "在 Lab 空间里调曲线：multi 模式把图层拆成分量层，各挂一条曲线，用 GIMP 原生的分量混合模式叠回去，每层可以单独关掉。恒等曲线时精确还原原图。"

#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:583
msgid "Adjust curves in Lab space: single mode packs the three components into one data image, one curve per channel, then an operation decodes it back to colour. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly; one layer, five filters."
msgstr "在 Lab 空间里调曲线：single 模式把三个分量打包进一张数据图，三条曲线各管一个通道，再由一个算子解回颜色。恒等曲线时精确还原原图，一层五条滤镜。"

#: plugin/lab-split-curves/lab-split-curves.py:589
msgid "Puts this layer into a pass-through group named Lab split; turn it off to stack it directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把这一层放进一个「Lab split」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/layer-to-channel/layer-to-channel.py:152
#: plugin/layer-to-selection/layer-to-selection.py:150
msgid "A layer group cannot be converted directly; right-click it and Merge Layer Group first."
msgstr "图层组不能直接转换：请先右键 → 合并图层组"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:509
msgid "Required operations are missing: %s. They are essential for exact LCh fitting (all three components must be evaluated in the same data image). Install this repository's GEGL operations lch-dual / lch-compose (./install.sh) and restart GIMP."
msgstr "缺少适配算子：%s。它们是 LCh 精确适配的必需组件（三个分量必须在同一张数据图里一起算）。请先安装本仓库的 GEGL 算子 lch-dual / lch-compose（./install.sh），重启 GIMP 再试。"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:588
msgid "LCh component layers created: %s. Editing each layer's \"curve\" adjusts that component; leave encode alone."
msgstr "LCh 分量层已建立：%s。改每层的「curve」就是调该分量的曲线；encode 别动。"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:590
msgid "\n(8-bit images must sit in a group: ungrouped, each layer quantises separately and the hue drifts by a few levels.)"
msgstr "\n（8 位图像必须放在组里：不分组会逐层量化，色相会偏几码。）"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:657
msgid "LCh layers created: %s. The L curve lives in \"2 · L curve\" (red channel), the chroma curve in \"3 · C curve\" (green channel) and the hue curve in \"4 · h curve\" (blue channel). Hide the original layer; this one reproduces it on its own."
msgstr "LCh 层已建立：%s。L 曲线在「2 · L curve」（红通道）、彩度曲线在「3 · C curve」（绿通道）、色相曲线在「4 · h curve」（蓝通道）。 原图层可以隐藏，这一层自己就能还原。"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:708
msgid "Adjust curves in LCh space: multi mode splits the layer into component layers, attaches one curve to each and stacks them back with GIMP's native component blend modes, so every layer can be switched off separately. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly."
msgstr "在 LCh 空间里调曲线：multi 模式把图层拆成分量层，各挂一条曲线，用 GIMP 原生的分量混合模式叠回去，每层可以单独关掉。恒等曲线时精确还原原图。"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:712
msgid "Adjust curves in LCh space: single mode packs the three components into one data image, one curve per channel, then an operation decodes it back to colour. Identity curves reproduce the original exactly; one layer, five filters."
msgstr "在 LCh 空间里调曲线：single 模式把三个分量打包进一张数据图，三条曲线各管一个通道，再由一个算子解回颜色。恒等曲线时精确还原原图，一层五条滤镜。"

#: plugin/lch-split-curves/lch-split-curves.py:718
msgid "Puts this layer into a pass-through group named LCh split; turn it off to stack it directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把这一层放进一个「LCh split」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:71
msgid "Maximum (dilate: bright areas grow)"
msgstr "最大值（膨胀：亮区外扩）"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:72
msgid "Minimum (erode: bright areas shrink)"
msgstr "最小值（腐蚀：亮区收缩）"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:76
msgid "Square ((±r, ±r) window)"
msgstr "方形（(±r, ±r) 方窗）"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:77
msgid "Round (disc of radius r)"
msgstr "圆形（半径 r 的圆盘）"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:128
msgid "The lb:max-min operation is missing; install the module from dist/ first."
msgstr "缺少算子 lb:max-min，请先安装 dist 里的模块。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:142
msgid "Nothing to work on: no drawable."
msgstr "没有可以处理的图层。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:145
msgid "A layer group has no pixels of its own; pick a raster layer or its mask."
msgstr "图层组没有自己的像素，请选一个栅格图层或它的蒙版。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:149
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "最大值"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:149
msgid "Minimum"
msgstr "最小值"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:180
msgid "mask"
msgstr "蒙版"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:181
msgid "channel"
msgstr "通道"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:206
msgid "Maximum / Minimum..."
msgstr "最大值 / 最小值…"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:211
msgid "Morphological maximum (dilate) and minimum (erode): each pixel takes the largest or smallest value in its neighbourhood. Maximum grows the edges and removes dark specks; minimum shrinks them and removes bright specks. Attached as a non-destructive filter on layers; written into pixels on masks and channels."
msgstr "形态学的最大值（膨胀）与最小值（腐蚀）：每个像素取邻域内的最大 / 最小值。最大值扩边、去暗点；最小值收边、去亮点。图层上以非破坏滤镜挂载，蒙版与通道直接写入像素。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:216
msgid "Morphological maximum (dilate) and minimum (erode) over a square or round neighbourhood, attached as a non-destructive drawable filter."
msgstr "在方形或圆形邻域上做形态学的最大值（膨胀）与最小值（腐蚀），以非破坏滤镜形式挂载到可绘制对象。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:224
msgid "Maximum is dilate, minimum is erode."
msgstr "最大值即膨胀，最小值即腐蚀。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:229
msgid "Neighbourhood radius in pixels. r=1 is a 3×3 window and grows the edge outward by one pixel."
msgstr "邻域半径（像素）。r=1 即 3×3 窗口，边缘向外长一圈。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:238
msgid "Square is a square window; round is a disc (Photoshop's Preserve: Squareness / Roundness)."
msgstr "方形即方窗；圆形即圆盘（对应 Photoshop 的方形度 / 圆度）。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:243
msgid "Affect alpha"
msgstr "影响 alpha"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:244
msgid "Leave off to keep alpha untouched (Photoshop does not change layer opacity either)."
msgstr "关掉时 alpha 原样保留（Photoshop 同样不改图层透明度）。"

#: plugin/max-min/max-min.py:253
msgid "Select a layer or one of its masks."
msgstr "请选择一个图层或它的蒙版。"

#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:165
#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:215
msgid "Neutral Grey"
msgstr "中性灰磨皮 (Neutral Grey)"

#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:171
msgid "1 · Neutral grey (white dodges, black burns)"
msgstr "1 · 中性灰（白提亮 / 黑压暗）"

#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:188
msgid "Neutral Grey is set up: a 50% grey soft-light layer that currently leaves the image identical. Click the layer and paint with a soft brush (opacity 5–15%): white lightens, black darkens, and #808080 paints over the overshoot."
msgstr "中性灰磨皮已建立：一张 50% 灰的柔光层，现在与原图完全一致。点中这一层，用柔边画笔（不透明度 5–15%）涂抹：白色提亮、黑色压暗，涂过头用 #808080 盖回去。"

#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:220
msgid "Neutral Grey: adds a 50% grey soft-light layer that is pixel-identical to the original when untouched. Paint white to lighten and black to darken, going over the skin until it evens out."
msgstr "中性灰磨皮：加一张 50% 灰的柔光层，恒等时与原图逐像素相同。白色画笔提亮、黑色画笔压暗，反复涂抹把皮肤推平。"

#: plugin/neutral-grey/neutral-grey.py:225
msgid "Puts the grey layer into a pass-through group named Neutral Grey; turn it off to stack it directly above the original layer."
msgstr "把灰层放进一个「中性灰磨皮」穿透组里；关掉就直接叠在原图层上方"

